The project is an educational Alfa-Hack prototype. Company profiles, credit
products, rates, balances and scoring results are synthetic examples, not real
bank offers. The Alfa name refers to the supplied case; no official bank assets
or corporate systems are included. Decorative graphics are implemented in CSS.

Mock integrations: company registry (EGRUL/EGRIP), FNS Transparent Business,
credit bureau. No external requests are made. Document upload stores metadata
only. Signature code 1234 and loan disbursement are simulations. There are no
payments, real signatures, real loans, paid APIs, AI models or external datasets.
